13.2 Math Insight
Alice wins iff n is even.
Why?

If n is even, Alice can choose x = 1, leaving odd.

From odd n, every divisor x is odd, so n - x is even.

Alice can always give Bob odd, Bob gives back even.

Eventually Bob reaches 1 and loses.
